    "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* [PM-20589] Open Source Dapp Connector by @iangregsondev in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/1\r\n* security: remove default workflow permissions by @gilescope in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/3\r\n* chore(deps): update eslint packages by @MidnightCI in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/5\r\n* chore(deps): update devdependencies (non-major) by @MidnightCI in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/4\r\n* build(deps): bump peter-evans/create-pull-request from 7.0.8 to 7.0.9 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/8\r\n* chore(deps): update yarn to v4.12.0 by @MidnightCI in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/6\r\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 5.0.0 to 6.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/7\r\n* [PM-20864] Fix failing CI due to duplicate action/checkout by @iangregsondev in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/11\r\n* Adjust transaction type specification for `balanceUnsealedTransaction` by @kapke in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/17\r\n* Refine discovery and connection specification to limit possibilities … by @kapke in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/15\r\n* Proving delegation by @kapke in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/12\r\n* Documentation and version bump to 4.0.0-beta.2 by @kapke in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/18\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @iangregsondev made their first contribution in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/1\r\n* @gilescope made their first contribution in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/3\r\n* @MidnightCI made their first contribution in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/5\r\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/8\r\n* @kapke made their first contribution in https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/pull/17\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/midnight-dapp-connector-api/commits/v4.0.0-beta.2",
